window.products.push({"id":715049,"name":"Iteryn Bento Box, Lunch Box Containers, 1500ml 3-Compartment Bento Box with Built-in Utensil Set, Dining Bento Box Leak Proof, Microwave/Dishwasher/Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710oFUYsHVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-COMPARTMENT BENTO BOX】Our bento box has a large capacity of 1500ml (8.7 x 6.5 x 3.3 inches) with 3 practical compartments and comes with a fork and spoon included. The perfect portion sizes ensure no mess, and you can bring various kinds of food for lunch in just one container. The individual compartments are also ideal for salads or snacks. 【FOOD GRADE MATERIAL】Our adult lunch containers are made of high-quality food-grade material (Grade 5 PP material), which is BPA-free, odorless, durable, reusable, easy to clean, stain-resistant, stronger, and more resistant to drops. It is the ideal lunch box for packing healthy food. 【LEAK-PROOF BENTO BOX】Our bento box features 4 kid-friendly lock clips that are easy for small hands to open and close, while the four-sided sealing snap with sealing silicone ring, and the lid edge fits tightly and snaps securely onto the lunch box, preventing any spills or leaks in your bag and keeping your food fresh. 【MICROWAVE AND DISHWASHER SAFE】Our lunch box can be heated in a microwave oven, but remember to remove the lid to prevent deformation caused by high temperatures. It is microwave safe up to a temperature of 248℉(within 3 mins); It can also be cleaned in the dishwasher (top rack only), but hand washing is recommended for the lid to avoid deformation. 【EASY TO CARRY & NON-SLIP】The perfect design with a capacity of 1500ml vs 49oz makes our Bento Box both large capacity and lightweight, so you can easily carry it in your bag. Unlike other bento boxes, our lunch boxes are equipped with a non-slip design at the bottom, preventing accidental slips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710oFUYsHVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iteryn","source_asin":"B0B7L4237J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7L4237J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7L4237J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
