window.products.push({"id":715473,"name":"Melange 40-Piece Place Premium Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Italian Villa Collection) | Service for 8 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinn, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JvepXV6jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Melange is about the essence of meals. It is designed to coordinate with your existing heirloom pottery as well as mix and match with formal and casual stemware and flatware. The premium porcelain material makes it suitable to serve your meals from the microwave; the large mugs are designed to welcome you in the mornings; the sophisticated yet functional design of the fine china place setting lets you shine during sushi for two or other special meals. The chip resistant plates will perform at your fiesta parties every time and wash white and clean in your dishwasher. It is vitrified to withstand everyday basic catering and can also be used as a commercial hotel collection or at the grand buffet of a wedding. Italian Villa dinnerware captures the life style of Tuscan nobility living in Italian Villa with views of breath-taking countryside. The dishware is inspired by columnar design of Italian mansions and has subtle ripples giving it truly a rich and aristocratic feel. The functional and yet timeless form gives the host plenty of opportunities to impress at formal dinner parties or at outdoor lunches on warm sunny afternoons. Each piece combines various aspects of famous Italian style and mixes and matches well with other conventional dinnerware and modern dining sets. Ready for life in an Italian Villa? The great white dinnerware set is made of premium vitrified porcelain also called new bone china, for its features of being thin like ivory china but still durable like premium dinnerware. Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F, Italian Villa makes it a great commercial product safe for cutting on with knives and keeping the food surface non-absorbent. It has close to 0-percent water porosity that keeps products strong and break resistant. It is safe for use from freezer to oven or microwave, and dishwasher. It's a great for a wedding, birthday or Christmas gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JvepXV6jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B00B7H2IWI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B7H2IWI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B7H2IWI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
