window.products.push({"id":715488,"name":"XSZ Modern Design Large Silent Water Drop Wall Clock Battery Operated for Kitchen Office Living Room Bedroom Decorative (9.5\" W x 20.4\" L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z1eY8yHOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Installation Steps: Step 1. Nail into the wall, leave the outer length is around 1 cm for hanging the clock. Step 2. Open the buckle on the back of the wall clock and hang the rocker (reference picture). Step 3. Put in two AA batteries and set the time. Step 4. Hang the wall clock on your nail. Product Basic Information： Size: 9.5\" W x 20.4\" L Weight: 0.5kg/1.1lb Material: Acrylic(Also called PMMA or plexiglass) Thickness: 0.3 \"/ 0.8cm Power: 2*AA battery (not included) Package Included: 1 x water drop wall clock 1 x cement nail 1 x screws The quality movement provides silence environment, Accurate time and long lifetime. Simple design, easy to hang, the wall clock is easily seen from a distance and decorated in many places. The pendulum of the clock swings left and right when it works. The wall clock Suitable for the living room/dining room/bedroom/office/entrance hall/meeting room and other places Feel free to contact us if you have any problem with this wall clock. Notice： 1. The first time, please manually set the time. 2.The pendulum slowly starts to swing from side to side. After installing the battery, please wait for one minute. 3.When hanging the wall clock, the nails should not be caught on the top of the control swing, avoid that the pendulum cannot swing left and right. 4. Due to production batch problems, individual products may not work properly, please contact us, we will give replacement or return refunds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z1eY8yHOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XSZ","source_asin":"B085KXVXY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085KXVXY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085KXVXY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
