window.products.push({"id":715496,"name":"Dependable Industries inc. Essentials Kitchen 4-Piece BPA-Free Batter Bowl Set with Pouring Spout, Handle, Non-Skid Base - Freezer Safe & Comfortable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5145rpOxakS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dependable Industries, a trusted name in kitchenware, presents their 4 Piece Batter Bowl Set - a versatile and practical addition to any kitchen! This set of four nesting bowls is designed to make your food prep tasks easier and more enjoyable. Crafted from heavy weight plastic, these bowls are built to withstand the rigors of everyday use. They are also BPA free, ensuring that your food remains safe and free from harmful chemicals. The non-skid rubber base on each bowl prevents them from sliding or moving around on your countertop, providing stability while you mix, whisk, or pour. Featuring a pouring spout and an open handle, these bowls are designed for maximum convenience. The pouring spout allows you to easily pour out batters, sauces, and liquids with precision, minimizing messes and spills. The open handle provides a comfortable grip and extra leverage while stirring or pouring, making your food prep tasks more efficient and enjoyable. This 4 Piece Batter Bowl Set comes in four different sizes - 1L, 1.5L, 2L, and 3L - giving you the perfect bowl for every task. From whisking eggs to crafting a BBQ marinade, these bowls are ideal for a wide range of cooking and baking needs. The nesting design allows them to stack inside each other, saving you precious storage space in your kitchen cabinets. In addition to their functional design, these bowls are also freezer safe, dishwasher safe, and microwave safe, providing you with versatility and convenience in your kitchen. The assorted colors of the bowls add a pop of brightness to your kitchen decor, making them both functional and stylish. Invest in Dependable Industries' 4 Piece Batter Bowl Set and elevate your food prep experience. With their durable construction, practical features, and space-saving design, these bowls are a must-have for any kitchen enthusiast or professional chef. Get yours today and enjoy hassle-free food prep like never before!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5145rpOxakS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dependable Industries inc. Essentials","source_asin":"B095XDGG3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095XDGG3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095XDGG3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
