window.products.push({"id":715504,"name":"Chuangdi Halloween Black Roses with Eyeballs Black Flowers with Stem Artificial Rose Bouquet Fake Rose Flowers for Halloween Party Arrangements Home W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814BmSOorPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  DIY fun: rose foam flowers are nice for making bouquets, centerpieces, kissing balls, cake flowers, or any other floral decor and setup you might want for a Halloween party home decor.  Realistic faux flowers: The flowers heads are made of quality silk, eyeballs are made of plastic. Creepy eyeballs are embellishment in a flower, makes Halloween party more interesting.  Use tips: The faux flowers are mostly made of silk materials, keep away from candlesticks, candles, incense and other fire sources. If the flowers are stuck with dust due to long-term placement, use a soft brush dipped in water to clean the petals and place them in a cool place to dry. If the flower is crushed, you can blow it with a hair dryer to restore its original shape and make the flower more three-dimensional and beautiful.  Specifications: Material: plastic, polyester Size: rose head is about 3.5 inches/ 9 cm, the eyeball is 0.79 inches/ 2 cm Color: black  Package includes: 12 x Black artificial roses  Notes: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The colors may exist slight difference due to different screens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814BmSOorPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUANGDI","source_asin":"B097DTCJF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097DTCJF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097DTCJF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":715505,"name":"NOVICA Brown Hand Crafted Suar Wood Relief Panel, 'Sunny Om'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fCTgvZA5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Om is a sacred symbol and mantra with great importance in both Hindu and Buddhist traditions, a meditative sound that is believed to resonate with all things in the universe. Made Mulyani, coming from a family of Indonesian artisans, proudly presents this wall relief, which is hand-carved from local suar wood to depict the om symbol surrounded by sun motifs.  - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly   About our Artist: 'I was born in 1975 to a wood carver family in a small rural area on the island of Bali. Our family was underprivileged, and I wasn't able to continue my studies after graduating from senior high school. In 2002, there was a very difficult moment in my life. I was starting a small shop in the market with a bank loan. Suddenly, a bomb exploded in Bali's tourist area! People suffered a lot because most work is dependent on tourism. Bali became so quiet, and no visitors or customers came. I think this was the toughest time in my whole life. My island is rich in artistry, so my family taught me to make sculptures. I started by watching them carving wood at home. I was excited with the final results and worked hard at learning how to create them. By creating these beautifully detailed sculptures and masks, we'd like to introduce our traditional culture to the world. I hope our sales will grow and people worldwide will come to know our culture.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fCTgvZA5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01JKGB6WA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JKGB6WA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JKGB6WA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
