window.products.push({"id":715585,"name":"MR.SIGA Toilet Bowl Brush and Holder, Premium Quality, with Solid Handle and Durable Bristles for Bathroom Cleaning, Black, 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dc+9O+A5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE CONSTRUCTION & ELEGANT DESIGN- Durable and dense PP fibers create long lasting bristles for strong cleaning ability but won't scratch the toilet bowl. Flat base secures the toilet bowl brush holder sitting in the bathroom steadily and won't slide easily. Elegant and stylish design works for any bathroom, it's a must-have accessory for your toilet bowl cleaning. SOLID & ERGONOMIC HANDLE - Features a thick and solid handle which fits comfortably in hand and ensures a firm grip while cleaning. 15.8\" solid handle brings you more convenience and allows for powerful scrubbing, leaves your toilet bowl spotless and sanitary. Ideal for residential, commercial, and industrial applications. REPLACEABLE BRUSH HEAD & SANITARY AND EFFICIENT CLEANING - Strong bristles are not easy to get deformed which remove stains easily, the dense bristles offer thorough and deep cleaning for under-rim area and those hard-to-reach corners. Water easily drips off bristles into bottom of holder, brings you a refreshing cleaning experience. For replacement brush head, please refer to ASIN B08YRRDKDQ. UPGRADED VENTILATION DESIGN - Lid opens automatically when toilet brush is lifted, and bottom ventilation allows for quick evaporation; Lid closes simultaneously when you place toilet brush back into holder, and the upper ventilation starts working which provides hygienic air dry. Compact space saving design keeps your toilet brush hidden and offers a sanitary storage. MR.SIGA's mission: Make your housework easier, and make the world cleaner. If you’re not happy about the product, you’re covered by a full refund. Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions you may have, we are here for support and advice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dc+9O+A5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MR.SIGA","source_asin":"B0C4PLZ5TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4PLZ5TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4PLZ5TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
