window.products.push({"id":715592,"name":"Gnome Christmas Decor Ornaments Set of 4, Handmade Swedish Tomte Gnomes Plush Scandinavian Santa Elf Table Ornaments Christmas Tree Hanging Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51efJnNb6mL._AC_.jpg","description":"GNOME DESIGNED: Christmas Gnomes Ornaments Set - Gnome, also known as a Tomte or Nisse.Gnome or Tomte, according to Scandinavian folklore, he is elderly, with a long beard. Gnomes are best known for guarding Earthly treasures and are perfect for protecting your Christmas goodies and adding some whimsy to your holiday decor. DIMENSION & MATERIAL: 6 inches tall from bottom to top of the hat. His very tall traditional hat is fiber fur and his felt mittens hides his ears and fingers safe from the cold. The Fiber fur long white beard and bulbous nose are well-known traits of the cunning gnome. Bendable wire in his ridiculously tall hat in order to pose it for maximum whimsy and ridiculousness! PREMIUM MATERIAL: Well handcrafted Swedish Gnome.His body and pink nose is crafted from soft felt, the thick white beard is made of premium fiber fur,and his hat is knitted with popular pattern. PACKAGE INCLUDED: 4PCS Handmade Swedish Gnome. Customer satisfaction and service quality are the basic criteria of Defemim. If anything ever goes wrong with your item, please feel free to contact us. PEFECT GIFT for CHRISTMAS: The adorable scandinavian gnome will be a unique ornament gift for spreading the holiday spirit, great for children exchanging their gifts during holiday seasons.Also a perfect ornament for gnome collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51efJnNb6mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Defemim","source_asin":"B07ZSHRSBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZSHRSBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZSHRSBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":715593,"name":"UrnConcern Severn Cremation Urn. A Hand Engraved Cremation Urn Manufactured from Solid Brass with Black Toledo Finish. 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HpAIF8BHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Severn line of cremation urns are manufactured from sold brass,hand carved and carefully packaged in a charming velvet drawstring pouch, for the full size and in a heart shaped velvet box for the keepsake. The Severn Black Toledo urn is expertly powder coated with black finish, and then delicately and masterfully hand engraved. The felt bottom protects surfaces from scratching. The lid securely and easily screws on, or off. We've created a special line of cremation urns that will always be in style, and will serve as a fitting receptacle for the ashes of a loved one. We know you will agree. Sizing Made Simple One pound of live weight equals one cubic inch of cremains. 3\" = 3 cubic inches 11\" = 202 cubic inches For example; A 175 pound person, would yield 175 cubic inches of cremains, which would fit into a 11\" urn. A 35 pound terrier will yield 35 cubic inches of cremains, and would fit into a 6\" urn. Thank you for your interest in an urn from UrnConcern. PLEASE NOTE - Severn Urns are sold separately - be sure that you are ordering the right size - either a 3\" or 11\". Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HpAIF8BHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UrnConcern","source_asin":"B01DANIBZO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DANIBZO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DANIBZO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
