window.products.push({"id":715654,"name":"CYS EXCEL Glass Candle Holders for 4\" Pillar or 3/4\" Taper Candle. Candle Holder Height-5\", Clear Glass, Wedding Decoration, Candlestick Pack of 2 PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FQAoUH39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why We Love It With this unique solid round design by CYS EXCEL, our Clear Glass Candle Holder which holds perfectly with your taper or pillar candles will definitely add a decorative accent to your dining table. This candle holder, also called candle stand will transform your space into a very warm and relaxing environment. Design & History Our Clear Glass Pillar Candle Holder / Taper Candle Holder comes with 2 different heights, which are 5\" and 8\". These 2 sizes share the same Base Diameter: 3.75\", Plate Diameter 5\" and the Top Plate Opening Diameter 4.75\". We also offer these items in different packagings in order to fit your needs when \"Pack of 2 PCS\" is more towards to home decor, \"Pack of 6 PCS\" and \"PACK of 12 PCS\" are more for events, weddings, restaurants, and churches. Glass Pillar Candle Holder. It comes in 2 sizes (Height). Dimension: Overall Height: 5 INCHES and 8 INCHES (Choose a height), Base Diameter: 3.75\", Plate Diameter: 5\", Plate Opening Diameter: 4.75\". This series of pillar candle holders are our staffs’ favorite pick. The stem featuring a single round bubble, decorate with brilliant simplicity is what the designers and brides cannot resist. This clear glass pillar candle holder is perfect for displaying your pillar candle (D-4.5\" or smaller) and it's ideal for both wick and LED candles. You will find a slight lip and an indented center for potential wax spillage. This piece is great for weddings, restaurants, and churches use. Specifications - Crafted of glass - Solid Clear Glass Material - Holds 1 taper or pillar candle, sold separately or a set. - Available in small and large sizes - Available in pack of 2, 6 and 12 - Large: 5\"Dia. x 8\"H - Small: 5\"Dia. x 5\"H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FQAoUH39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYS EXCEL","source_asin":"B075431H3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075431H3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075431H3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
