window.products.push({"id":715734,"name":"Holly Lines Tea Towels Pot Holders Cookie Cutter and Dog Bone Recipe in Bundle, Funny Kitchen Towels Set with Pot Holders Dog Bone Cookie Cutter and D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-vGkUFf6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This fun bundle has three decorative Home Collection funny dish towels, two high temperature pot holders, a large dog biscuit cookie cutter, and a cute recipe card for hearty whole wheat dog biscuits. A THREE-FER The complementing funny dish towels tell the whole story about canine companions. The grey towel with white paw prints proudly announces, \"My kids have paws!\" in white script. The white towel with light grey paw prints and black text solemnly asserts, \"Love starts with a wet nose and ends with a tail!\" And the teal towel with white words and tiny white paws confidently proclaims, \"Life is better with a furry companion!\" A COOL DUO The two durable, well-insulated, and generously sized white and black hot pan holders will give years of reliable service. The pot holder pair protects to 400 degrees F. They also double as serving trivets for larger pans. A CUT ABOVE The generously sized cookie cutter dog bone shape is made of sturdy aluminum with a spot-welded seam so it will last through hundreds of dog biscuit baking sessions. It also cleans easily and is dishwasher safe. A FINAL TREAT To complete the kit, you get a complimentary recipe to use with your cookie cutter. The recipe card features a sweet, attentive Yorkie waiting for a good behavior reward. The simple, 5-ingredient whole wheat dog biscuit recipe gives full, clear directions for quick and nutritious treats that your pampered puppy will love. (And if you're not a baker, send the card as a heart-warming greeting to a fellow pooch pushover who does bake!) Score!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-vGkUFf6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H HOLLY LINES","source_asin":"B08B917N1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B917N1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B917N1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
