window.products.push({"id":715868,"name":"WHALL Toaster 2 slice Stainless Steel Toasters with Bagel, Cancel, Defrost Function, 1.5in Wide Slot, 6 Shade Settings, Removable Crumb Tray, High Lif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p3oZgVx7L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"🧇【Defrost & Bagel & Cancel Functions】①DEFROST: Each gear time is 8%-12% longer than the corresponding normal gear time.②BAGEL: Bagel setting toasts the inside and the other side keeps warm.③CANCEL: You can cancel the baking process at any time, just press the CANCEL button. 🥪【Evenly Baking & Safety】The 2 Slice Toaster, external use of high-end durable stainless steel material, can ensure a long time high-temperature baking,and high-temperature heating does not deform. Internal use of bidirectional surround heating technology, heat pipe two-way wound in the body, without turning over, and the 2 piece toaster just needs 2 minutes to bake the same burnt color and can make bread up and down heating uniform, avoid unevenness of baking effectively. 🥯【1.5 In Extra-Wide Slots】The toaster featured with 1.5-inch wide slot,which can be used to bake different types of bread,such as waffle,or thick artisanal bread. Choosing from lightly golden to dark toasted slices from 1 to 6 gears accommodated by individual preferences. When using it for the first time, if you are baking two slices of bread at the same time, it is recommended that you select medium gear 3 or 4. If you are baking one slice of bread, please select the lower gear of 1 or 2. 🍞【Easy to Clean & Storage】Always switch off the toaster, unplug the power cord, and allow the toaster to cool down, before removing the crumb tray or cleaning or moving the toaster. Do not immerse or place the toaster or power cord in any liquids or drip any liquids on the toaster to avoid the risk of electric shock and damage; Bread crumbs are collected in a removable tray at the bottom of the toaster, so just pull it out and clean the crumbs immediately! ❣️【Note】In daily use, be sure to bake two slices of bread at the same time, as this will prevent uneven baking. When you want to bake only one slice of bread, please just select the 1 gear, otherwise the bread may be burnt. It is normal that the outside surface is hot when it is working, please do not touch hot surfaces by finger or hand directly, but use handles or knobs. We Provide a 12-month Guarantee, if you receive defective products or are not satisfied with them, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p3oZgVx7L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"whall","source_asin":"B0C73X8YDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C73X8YDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C73X8YDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
