window.products.push({"id":715870,"name":"Premium Champagne Glasses Set - sevdele Love Series Toasting Flutes Wedding Set - Stylish Champagne Glass Set for Engagements - Affordable, Durable Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ylYLuBb7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You know the feeling when you want to give something that says everything? It’s rare to find a gift that will portray your true feelings to your loved ones. Nothing will say it more than these modern yet classical wine glasses that celebrate connection, romance and success. This is what our handcrafted Sevdelé “Love Series” flutes are all about. Champagne as it should be Drinking from a stemless flute warms your champagne in a matter of minutes, turning the drink flat and un-enjoyable. Our traditionally styled stemmed glasses allow you to hold your champagne or sparkling wine without changing its taste and your drinking experience. Give the gift of love We've seen our champagne glasses gifted for many different occasions. Gift it for a special birthday, wedding, engagement, anniversary, for your bridesmaid, at Christmas time or as a beautiful gift for mom. Imagine the look on your loved ones’ face when they receive this beautifully hand crafted set of 2 premium champagne glasses. Invest in quality Unlike plastic flutes, Sevdelé flutes don’t retain residual odors which disturb the flavors of your champagne. Your guests will be impressed with the sleek, classic sophistication of these decorative flutes. Each glass holds a generous 6 ounces and you can be assured your glasses are durable and safe in top rack of the dishwasher. Beautiful champagne glasses Sevdelé champagne flutes are made of the highest quality lead-free glass, hand blown and crafted by highly skilled glass blowers. Each champagne flute is individually made and hand painted with unique decorative styling, giving each champagne glass a rose gold highlighted finish, making this set of champagne glasses a true work of art! Securely enclosed in a premium matt black packaging with metallic rose gold embossing that you will simply love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ylYLuBb7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sevdele","source_asin":"B0736N5F6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0736N5F6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0736N5F6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
