window.products.push({"id":715923,"name":"Christmas Tree Topper Lighted Snowflake with LED Rotating Santa Claus and Reindeer Projector Lights, LED Treetop Projector, for Christmas Ornament for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S5cHc+GHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【High Brightness and Larger Projection Range】 - Upgraded projection Christmas tree toppers increased the projection brightness and larger coverage. Distance to ceiling 3ft, Projection range is about 3ft. You don’t worry about the tree topper being too close to the ceiling and affecting the projection range. Of course, the farther away from the ceiling, the larger the projection range and the better the effect. 🎄【Excellent Projection Effect】The built-in magic LED rotating projector can project the dynamic pattern of high-definition snowflakes. The upgraded blizzard projection pattern has a bigger, higher definition, more numbers of beautiful snowflakes, and more realistic dynamic snowflake patterns, just like real snowflakes falling from the sky. What’s more, the motor sound is quieter 🎄【Stable & Easy to intall】This Christmas tree topper is designed with a conical column for attaching to the tree, Universal size for all kinds of tree, so you have no worries about it can't fit your tree, more stable than the usual base. Just fix the Christmas tree topper snowflake on the top, then plug it into the socket, enjoy the unique and fairy display for your house. 🎄【Snowflake shape design】 The Snowflake shape more matches the theme of Christmas snow, dress up the Christmas tree nicely. It is very suitable for decorating Christmas trees, Christmas decorations, holiday parties, family dances, birthdays, weddings, gardens, shopping malls, and more. It can also be used as a Christmas gift for family, lovers, and friends. 🎄【Healthy Material】The Christmas tree topper star is made of environmentally friendly and high-quality PVC material, harmless to your family body. It is the most indispensable ornament for the Christmas festival, and it is the best choice for your Christmas decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S5cHc+GHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giguelove","source_asin":"B09DD5QYCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-715923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DD5QYCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DD5QYCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
